media/anime/banner/8197-cgyJpYAANd1M.jpg"}]}},"related":[{"title":"Sound of the Sky","link":"/anime/1804-sound-of-the-sky","image":"https://img.animeunity.co/anime/bx6802-MmsfM8KAgZuR.jpg","type":"TV","year":"2010","dubStatus":"subbed","dubStatusKey":"Subbed","variants":[{"status":"subbed","statusKey":"Subbed","title":"Sound of the Sky","link":"/anime/1804-sound-of-the-sky","image":"https://img.animeunity.co/anime/bx6802-MmsfM8KAgZuR.jpg"}]},{"title":"Sound of the Sky Specials","link":"/anime/4277-sound-of-the-sky-specials","image":"https://img.animeunity.co/anime/gwgim.png","type":"Special","year":"2010","dubStatus":"subbed","dubStatusKey":"Subbed","variants":[{"status":"subbed","statusKey":"Subbed","title":"Sound of the Sky Specials","link":"/anime/4277-sound-of-the-sky-specials","image":"https://img.animeunity.co/anime/gwgim.png"}]}],"linkList":[{"title":"Episodes 1-2","titleKey":"Episodes {{start}}-{{end}}","titleParams":{"start":1,"end":2},"availabilityStatus":"available","episodesLink":"4277|1|2"}]},"episodes":[{"title":"Episodio 1","episodeNumber":1,"sourceEpisodeNumber":1,"seasonNumber":0,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anilist","id":"8197","episodeNumbers":[1]},{"provider":"mal","id":"8197","episodeNumbers":[1]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"35461","scope":"s0","seasonNumber":0,"episodeNumbers":[1]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"132771","scope":"s0","seasonNumber":0,"episodeNumbers":[1]}],"link":"67665","synopsis":"Rio, Filicia and Kureha have trouble keeping their illegal alcohol distillery a secret from both Kanata and Yumina. After giving everyone a special brew of tea, spiked with their home-made alcohol, Filicia suggests a mock battle using water guns that, if Kanata’s team wins, she would be told the truth. Having gotten a little drunk from the alcohol, everyone gets a bit too into character. Kanata’s team gets the upper hand when Noël brings out a Gatling gun, taking down Filicia in the process. However, they soon run out of ammo and Noël and Yumina get knocked out. Kanata eventually stumbles upon the secret distillery and comes up against Rio and defeats her. After recovering from the battle, Kanata promises to keep the distillery a secret, before spending the night with everyone getting drunk. Kureha, being the only one who could not get drunk, is left to recall the horrors the others subjected her to.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7Vl0sjQPuog4KAtFehuPV0xymwm.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 1","synopsis":"Rio, Filicia and Kureha have trouble keeping their illegal alcohol distillery a secret from both Kanata and Yumina. After giving everyone a special brew of tea, spiked with their home-made alcohol, Filicia suggests a mock battle using water guns that, if Kanata’s team wins, she would be told the truth. Having gotten a little drunk from the alcohol, everyone gets a bit too into character. Kanata’s team gets the upper hand when Noël brings out a Gatling gun, taking down Filicia in the process. However, they soon run out of ammo and Noël and Yumina get knocked out. Kanata eventually stumbles upon the secret distillery and comes up against Rio and defeats her. After recovering from the battle, Kanata promises to keep the distillery a secret, before spending the night with everyone getting drunk. Kureha, being the only one who could not get drunk, is left to recall the horrors the others subjected her to.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7Vl0sjQPuog4KAtFehuPV0xymwm.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 2","episodeNumber":2,"sourceEpisodeNumber":2,"seasonNumber":0,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anilist","id":"8197","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"mal","id":"8197","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"35461","scope":"s0","seasonNumber":0,"episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"132771","scope":"s0","seasonNumber":0,"episodeNumbers":[2]}],"link":"67666","synopsis":"When asked by Mishio what her dream is, Kanata is unsure how to answer. Kanata is given a letter sent to Rio from the Roman Emperor, and goes to find Rio so she can sign it. Whilst in town, she runs into Yumina and learns why Mishio asked her. Kanata later learns from Naomi and Maria that Rio might have wondered off somewhere. Kanata later finds Rio at some ruins, who was wondering about the true story behind the Maidens of Fire that Aisha had told them. Rio then explains that outside of Seize, there are a lot of wars going on. Later that night, Rio takes Kanata on a hot air balloon ride, where she tells her her dream of rebuilding the airplane. The next day, as Kanata is picked to play the role of a fire maiden, Kanata decides her dream is to follow Rio on her dream.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pO7X5p7a4wQ7i3OH20tzYwJf3OU.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 2","synopsis":"When asked by Mishio what her dream is, Kanata is unsure how to answer. Kanata is given a letter sent to Rio from the Roman Emperor, and goes to find Rio so she can sign it. Whilst in town, she runs into Yumina and learns why Mishio asked her. Kanata later learns from Naomi and Maria that Rio might have wondered off somewhere. Kanata later finds Rio at some ruins, who was wondering about the true story behind the Maidens of Fire that Aisha had told them. Rio then explains that outside of Seize, there are a lot of wars going on. Later that night, Rio takes Kanata on a hot air balloon ride, where she tells her her dream of rebuilding the airplane. The next day, as Kanata is picked to play the role of a fire maiden, Kanata decides her dream is to follow Rio on her dream.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pO7X5p7a4wQ7i3OH20tzYwJf3OU.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}}],"mappings":{"source":"anibridge-v3","schemaVersion":"3.0.3","generatedOn":"2026-10-30T07:57:40Z","sourceDescriptors":["anilist:8197","mal:8197"],"imdbSource":"plexanibridge-v2","targets":[{"provider":"ani